aktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:48.17,0:01:58.16,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:45.09,0:01:47.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ada uçuyor mu?Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.37,0:01:52.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle bir şey mümkün mü?Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.22,0:01:57.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl bir adam bu Kaido?Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.22,0:01:59.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.73,0:02:01.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.10,0:02:03.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.69,0:02:06.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anka Kuşu Marco mu?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.94,0:02:12.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyleyse... bu iş görür!Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.84,0:02:16.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ay! Ay, ay, ay!Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.53,0:02:17.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper-san!Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.97,0:02:21.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanıyorum, aman! Diri diri yanıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.04,0:02:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Isıtacağına yaktın hayvanı...Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.87,0:02:26.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynı taraftayız zannetmiştim...Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.73,0:02:27.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco-san!Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.88,0:02:29.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco...!Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.34,0:02:35.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hemen parlıyor bunlar da.Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.97,0:02:38.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ay, ay, ay, ay, ay...Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.33,0:02:40.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper-san, hemen söndürüyorum seni.Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.64,0:02:43.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kolum alev aldı!Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.81,0:02:45.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de cayır cayır–Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.69,0:02:47.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanlış alarm.Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.41,0:02:48.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu alev...Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.98,0:02:51.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ay! Ay, ay...Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.40,0:02:51.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper, sakinleş.Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.44,0:02:52.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.15,0:02:53.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ay ay!Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.85,0:02:55.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanlış alarm.Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.72,0:02:58.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alev aldığım hâlde yanmıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.49,0:03:02.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu alevin rahatlatan bir...Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.02,0:03:03.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sıcaklığı var.Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.65,0:03:05.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Dr. Chopper! – Dr. Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.67,0:03:07.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Antikor üretimi için her şey hazır!Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.83,0:03:09.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir an önce buraya gelin!Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.16,0:03:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buz şeytanı sürüsü!Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.04,0:03:20.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Miyagi, Tristan kaçın!Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.18,0:03:22.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Madem herkes ısıtılmalı...Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.27,0:03:27.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anka Pasif Alevi!Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.65,0:03:34.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yandım!Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.19,0:03:36.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ay, ay, ay, ay, ay, ay...Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.49,0:03:40.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, o kadar da sıcak değil.Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.00,0:03:46.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Donmam kesildi.Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.46,0:03:49.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ay, ay, ay, ay...Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.74,0:03:51.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.12,0:03:53.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Ben ne...?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.34,0:03:55.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Omasa!Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.26,0:03:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şükürler olsun, bilincini tekrar kazandın.Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.72,0:04:01.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Omasa...!Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.60,0:04:05.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin de dediğin gibi, vücut sıcaklıkları artıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.68,0:04:09.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dayanacak güçleri kalmayınca tekrar şeytana dönecekler.Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.94,0:04:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Size biraz vakit kazandırdım, o kadar.Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.69,0:04:17.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sağ ol!Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.53,0:04:20.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek istediğim buydu.Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.45,0:04:23.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Miyagi! Tristan!Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.28,0:04:25.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi misiniz?Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.04,0:04:28.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E-Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.54,0:04:30.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyiyiz!Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.17,0:04:32.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşe koyulalım!Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.67,0:04:35.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz de sana yardım edeceğiz!Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.51,0:04:39.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sağ olun! O kulede üretime yoğunlaşabilirim.Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.30,0:04:44.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco!Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.64,0:04:49.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O dallama da tanuki bozuntusu da eğlencemin içine ettiler!Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.27,0:04:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yakalasanıza lan şu tanukiyi!Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.90,0:04:57.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi kurtaracağını cidden düşündünüz mü?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.19,0:05:00.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama o tanuki...Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.40,0:05:03.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tereddüte düşmeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.12,0:05:08.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Canınızı seviyorsanız o tanukiyi temizleyip antikoru geri alın!Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.25,0:05:14.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada neler döndüğünü aşağı yukarı anladım.Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.13,0:05:16.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Roronoa!Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.09,0:05:19.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidip Kaido'yu kesmeyecek misin?Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.01,0:05:22.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çatı katına gitmek istiyorsan...Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.55,0:05:25.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,seni oraya uçurabilirim.Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.26,0:05:28.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz de ayak takımıyla uğraşmak istemezsiniz herhâlde.Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.52,0:05:34.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fakat biz Chopper-san'a yardım etmeliyiz.Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.69,0:05:41.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Merak etmeyin, İskelet-san!Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.74,0:05:45.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tanuki-san'ı biz kollarız!Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.41,0:05:51.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güveniyorum size.Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.46,0:06:00.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gel lan buraya it.Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.84,0:06:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apoo!Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.26,0:06:09.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Antikoru geri ver!Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.60,0:06:15.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu kaybedersem...Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.73,0:06:19.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hayatım biter!Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.73,0:06:21.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir rahat ver!Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.15,0:06:23.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dişli bir rakip.Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.24,0:06:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi şu işi de aradan çıkaralım!Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.83,0:06:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tanuki-san, siz kuleye geçin.Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.30,0:06:47.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Apoo-san! – Apoo-san!Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.93,0:06:52.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu herif...Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.31,0:06:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drake-san?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.98,0:06:56.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Harbi taraf değiştirmiş!Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.32,0:07:07.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roronoa Zoro, beni sizden biri olarak görüyorsan...Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.91,0:07:10.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,burayı bana bırakıp önden git!Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.00,0:07:16.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru ata oynamayı biliyorsun.Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.00,0:07:21.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.38,0:07:28.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji üçüncü katta güçlü bir düşman sezip onu durduruyor olmalı.Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.64,0:07:29.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olabilir...!Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.01,0:07:32.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gözlem hakimi geliştirmem lazım.Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.89,0:07:35.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji'nin yerini, hatta varlığını bile sezemiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.82,0:07:43.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir şeyler seziyor musun, Jinbe?Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.28,0:07:44.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.07,0:07:47.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sayıları çok fazla.Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.41,0:07:49.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üstelik...Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.41,0:07:52.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,güçlüler de.Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.21,0:08:02.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçimizden biri bu katta kalsa iyi olacak.Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.17,0:08:07.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dikkatlerini üzerime çekeceğim, sen devam et.Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.80,0:08:10.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kollayın kendinizi!Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.05,0:08:12.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,General...Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.93,0:08:15.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roketatarı!Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.57,0:08:29.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi geliyor gelmekte olan!Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.95,0:08:31.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,General...Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.82,0:08:33.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Topu!Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.54,0:08:36.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri çekilin!Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.21,0:08:48.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moron gibi her tarafa ateş ediyorsun.Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.14,0:08:54.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendini bir halt sanma ulan!Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.68,0:08:58.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vay babam vay.Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.15,0:09:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Triceratops!Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.24,0:09:10.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinozormuşsun sen de.Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.86,0:09:15.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teslim ol. Tarihin en güçlü canlısı bu!Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.45,0:09:19.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni paramparça edip hurdaya çevireceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.58,0:09:23.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wapo metalinin ışıltısını yok et de göreyim!Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.19,0:09:44.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tobi Roppo!Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.82,0:09:56.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nereye gitti bunlar?Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.78,0:10:00.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kafayı yiyeceğim sinirden.Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.12,0:10:04.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O şıllığın kafasından kıvılcım çıkaracağım!Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.39,0:10:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O yöne kaçtı.Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.51,0:10:20.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dur bakayım!Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.06,0:10:21.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beklesene!Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.11,0:10:28.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hay! Bu ne be?Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.65,0:10:30.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çözün beni hemen!Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.11,0:10:32.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Debelenirmiş de.Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.65,0:10:37.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayıp, kaçıyorsun.Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.74,0:10:40.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demedin mi...Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.74,0:10:44.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,beni sevdiğini?Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.93,0:10:59.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ebediyen burada kalsana. Oyuncağım ol.Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.18,0:11:01.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saçmalama! Gitmem...Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.97,0:11:03.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gitmem gerekiyor!Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.02,0:11:04.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.65,0:11:08.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hangi yöne...Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.44,0:11:11.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bakarsam bakayım...Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.23,0:11:13.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hep kadın var.Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.57,0:11:18.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası...Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.07,0:11:19.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,cennet mi?Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.66,0:11:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aklını kaçırmış.Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.04,0:11:26.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok tatlış bir şeysin sen.Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.50,0:11:34.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka önden gitti.Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.30,0:11:37.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-san'ın canını sıkacaktır.Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.06,0:11:43.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adamlarımla uğraşmayı...Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.72,0:11:45.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,keser misin?Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.69,0:11:56.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eski Shichibukai, Denizin Şövalyesi Jinbe çocuk gibi davranıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.20,0:12:01.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalar'ın dümencisiyim ben.Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.08,0:12:04.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu unvanımı kullanmanı yeğlerim.Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.08,0:12:06.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, affola.Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.91,0:12:11.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shichibukai olduğun dönem görmüştüm seni.Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.21,0:12:12.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.13,0:12:15.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unut gitsin dediğimi.Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.38,0:12:17.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen kimsin?Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.26,0:12:21.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimim, sen söyle.Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.01,0:12:25.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maskeni çıkarayım, kimmişsin anlarım.Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.94,0:12:30.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olmayacak duaya amin deme.Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.24,0:12:40.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pek kimse bakmadığından bir süre burada saklanabiliriz.Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.49,0:12:43.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu nedir?Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.99,0:12:45.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ejderha heykeli.Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.66,0:12:51.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eskiden adanın girişindeydi ama arkadaşım kırınca buraya koyduk.Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.79,0:12:53.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arkadaşın mı?Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.50,0:12:55.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet...Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.09,0:12:56.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Birkaç yıl önce tanıştık.Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.76,0:13:00.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babamı öldürmeye gelmişti.Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.56,0:13:12.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayda, kimse yok mu?Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.86,0:13:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşgalciler!Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.33,0:13:26.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim işim Kaido'yla!Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.13,0:13:34.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.25,0:13:36.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz fırsat varken çocukları kurtarın!Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.80,0:13:38.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlaşıldı!Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.01,0:13:38.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bize bırak!Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.76,0:13:43.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keçi gibi inatçı!Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.18,0:13:51.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen kimsin? Adını söyle!Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.10,0:13:53.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Önce sen!Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.23,0:13:59.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adım Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.99,0:14:01.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun kellesini almaya geldim!Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.95,0:14:07.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buldum onları! Buraya gelin!Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.83,0:14:13.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korkmayın, sizi kurtarmaya geldik.Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.08,0:14:14.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi kalkın gidelim.Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.84,0:14:25.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güçlüsün.Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.14,0:14:31.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.23,0:14:34.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çocuklar güvende.Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.31,0:14:37.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama hedefimiz Kaido ortalıkta yok!Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.52,0:14:38.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.82,0:14:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babamlar keşif gezisinde.Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.86,0:14:42.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu anda bu adada...Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.86,0:14:44.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,tek bir rütbeli yok!Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.03,0:14:46.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baba derken?Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.12,0:14:47.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne?! – Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.53,0:14:50.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun kızı mı bu?Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.12,0:14:54.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim adım Yamato!Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.96,0:14:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kadar ortalığı yakıp yıktığımız yeter.Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.34,0:15:00.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim olduğumu soracak vaktiniz varsa...Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.46,0:15:05.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hemen burayı terk edip o çocukları ailelerine kavuşturun!Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.64,0:15:08.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teklifini kabul ediyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.89,0:15:11.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gitmemize izin vermen sorun olmasın?Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.43,0:15:14.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu adayı korumak gibi bir görevim yok.Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.49,0:15:27.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi Wano'ya dönelim.Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.16,0:15:29.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aileleriniz sizi bekliyor.Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.58,0:15:33.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar teşekkür etsek az.Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.58,0:15:35.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Son kararın mı Ace?Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.29,0:15:38.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz sensiz ana karaya dönüyoruz.Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.13,0:15:42.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, çocuklar size emanet. Sonra size katılırım.Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.47,0:15:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle güçlü birinin kaptan falan olmayışını aklım almıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.35,0:15:53.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hesabımızı kapatalım!Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.68,0:15:56.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim de canım sıkılıyordu zaten.Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.19,0:15:57.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dövüşelim!Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.53,0:16:10.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ateş Yumruk!Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.47,0:16:35.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden? Bu kadar güçlü olduğun hâlde neden denize açılmıyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.64,0:16:38.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onun suçu.Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.60,0:16:40.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun!Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.94,0:16:43.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle biri babam.Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.82,0:16:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babanın suçu mu?Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.61,0:16:50.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bahane mi arıyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.95,0:16:57.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anne babamızı...Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.91,0:17:01.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,seçemeyiz, Yamato!Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.17,0:17:06.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes sesini! Demesen de farkındayım!Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.13,0:17:09.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emin misin?Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.76,0:17:14.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babandan bu kadar nefret ediyorsan ellerini geçtim...Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.97,0:17:17.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ne diye kalbine de zincir vurduruyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.58,0:17:38.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato!Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.12,0:17:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asıl isteğin nedir?Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.16,0:18:15.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendimi...Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.28,0:18:18.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,baskıladığımı kabul ediyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.16,0:18:21.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi gözlerim açıldı.Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.62,0:18:26.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de denize açılıp maceralara atılmak istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.09,0:18:30.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden gibi özgürce yaşamak istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.13,0:18:32.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denize...Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.63,0:18:34.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denize...Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.26,0:18:36.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu lanet adadan kurtulup...Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.10,0:18:40.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,özgürce yaşamak istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.48,0:18:46.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha şöyle, Yamato!Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.04,0:19:02.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru yolu buldun.Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.12,0:19:04.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir karara vardın.Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.26,0:19:14.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.68,0:19:22.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonra da eve dayak yemiş hâlde geldi.Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.60,0:19:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çocukken az yaramaz değildi.Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.40,0:19:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kardeşin alemmiş.Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.69,0:19:30.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyledir.Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.23,0:19:33.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dışarıda işler ne durumda?Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.61,0:19:36.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gençler nam peşinde koşuyor mu?Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.28,0:19:38.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gençler mi? Bir düşüneyim.Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.24,0:19:41.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Caven bilmem ne diye biri çok konuşuluyor.Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.87,0:19:43.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.33,0:19:45.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rakipsiz beni saymazsak...Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.91,0:19:49.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,her denizde belalı tiplerin çıkış yaptığı duyumları aldım.Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hıhı! Hıhı!Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.25,0:19:53.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güney denizinde Kid,Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.38,0:19:56.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kuzeyde Law ve batıda Bege.Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.38,0:20:01.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama en adından söz edilecek adam birkaç yıla gelecek.Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.01,0:20:02.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kardeşim olur kendisi!Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.89,0:20:06.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Büyük biri olacağına inancım tam!Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.48,0:20:09.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kardeşin de kardeşin, daha ne kadar bahsedeceksin?Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.73,0:20:11.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,1 milyon kere de olsa dinle!Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.48,0:20:13.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ay, ay, ay!Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.07,0:20:15.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni ayyaş!Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.78,0:20:15.74,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, y-yapma!Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.91,0:20:25.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aslında bu heykeli ilk kıran bendim.Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.54,0:20:28.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama dedi ki...Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.79,0:20:34.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Kaido için geri geleceğim, ayağını denk alsın."Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.38,0:20:35.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum...Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.92,0:20:40.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'yu kurtarmaya çalışan bir korsan olduğunu bilmiyordum.Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.05,0:20:42.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babam köpürdü tabii.Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.22,0:20:44.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiç Ace'le karşılaşma fırsatı bulamadı.Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.43,0:20:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir dakika.Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.48,0:20:47.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baban mı?Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.35,0:20:50.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babam Kaido demedim mi?Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.19,0:20:57.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne– Hey, korkmayın o kadar!Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.11,0:20:59.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de ondan nefret ediyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.70,0:21:01.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden'im demiştim, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.74,0:21:03.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha da aklımız karıştı!Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.41,0:21:06.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benden korkmayın, ben de Kaido'dan nefret ediyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.83,0:21:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz ve macera hayaliyle özgürce yaşayan Oden oldum.Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.33,0:21:13.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Konuyu anladık.Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.34,0:21:15.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İlk yardım için minnettarız.Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.42,0:21:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Resmiyeti kesip yanıma gelin!Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.92,0:21:19.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki Yamato...Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.34,0:21:23.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'yu kurtarmaya çalışmış o adam şu an nerede?Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.01,0:21:24.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace...Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.30,0:21:26.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,iki yıl önce öldü.Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.77,0:21:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama, Ace'i tanıyor musun?Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.39,0:21:31.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, çok yakındık.Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.98,0:21:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace'e inanarak kunoichi olmak istedim...Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.57,0:21:39.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ama Luffy ağabey pat diye...Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.24,0:21:43.95,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace öldü.Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.03,0:21:46.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...onun öldüğünü söyledi.Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.91,0:21:49.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok üzüldüm.Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.33,0:21:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, kusura bakma.Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.12,0:21:53.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O da böyle biri.Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.71,0:21:58.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama Otama, Luffy de çok acı çekti.Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.00,0:21:59.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O olayda...Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.01,0:21:59.59,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.84,0:22:03.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadsiz!Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.01,0:22:09.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.68,0:22:11.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco'yu durdurun!Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.64,0:22:15.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dilediğini yapmasın!Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.19,0:22:20.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adam bizi kurtardı.Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.32,0:22:24.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle de Queen-sama bizi öldürsün mü?Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.03,0:22:27.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tereddüt etmeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.28,0:22:29.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emrimi yerine getirin!Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.42,0:22:38.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu an Kaido'ya doğrudan saldırmak gibi bir niyetim yok.Dialogue: 50,0:22:39.59,0:22:43.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, İskelet Adam, siz görevinizi yapın!Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.30,0:22:45.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaleye koşun!Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.55,0:22:46.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidelim!Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.80,0:22:48.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz öyle diyorsanız.Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.64,0:22:51.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geber Marco!Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.44,0:23:02.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşin bitti, Anka Kuşu Marco!Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.08,0:23:14.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hazır mısın?Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.96,0:23:15.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.81,0:23:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco piçi...Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.02,0:23:39.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyiymiş böyle.Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.31,0:23:44.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yonko Kaido'ya doğru gidiyorsun ama çok rahatsın.Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.28,0:23:47.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'dan korkmak ne işime yarayacak?Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.16,0:23:50.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptanım bir emir verdiyse ona uyarım.Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.62,0:23:54.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de Hasır Şapka'ya güveniyorum. Hayır...Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.25,0:23:57.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,En Kötü Nesil'e.Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.79,0:24:04.09,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kardeşinin bir Yonko'yla kavgaya tutuşacağını bilseydi ne tepki verirdi acaba?Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.71,0:24:06.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N'olur babalık.Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.72,0:24:08.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olmaz dedim, ahmak.Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.30,0:24:14.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaç defa anlattım sana Ace.Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.89,0:24:20.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senden önceki 2. tümen komutanının kim olduğunu...Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.06,0:24:22.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve o koltuğun neden uzun bir süre boş kaldığını.Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.69,0:24:27.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano dış dünyaya kapalı olduğundan içeriden haber alamıyoruz.Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.03,0:24:33.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz dahi ölümünü birkaç yıl sonra öğrendik.Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.29,0:24:40.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'ya yürümeyi düşündük ama sonuçlarını hesaba katmalıyız.Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.92,0:24:43.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bedeli ne olur hiç kafa yordun mu?Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.17,0:24:45.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bedeli mi?Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.05,0:24:48.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek benim gitmeme izin ver o zaman!Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.68,0:24:53.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir söz verdim.Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.64,0:24:58.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden'in yenemediği adamı...Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.77,0:25:05.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sen nasıl yeneceksin?Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.65,0:25:08.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendini bu kadar büyük görme, Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:25:20.67,0:25:23.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden çok güçlüydü anasını satayım.Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.13,0:25:28.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek gerçekten de büyük isimleri devirmek niyetindesin, Komutan Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.72,0:25:31.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes sesini, Teach.Dialogue: 50,0:25:31.01,0:25:34.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace büyük isimleri devirmek istemiyor.Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.35,0:25:38.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siktir.Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.60,0:25:45.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güçlenmezsem sözümü tutamam.Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.02,0:25:49.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bütün meselen buymuş demek...Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.61,0:25:54.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babalıktan izni koparırsan Ace, beni de davet edersin.Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.66,0:25:56.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni de say.Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.37,0:26:00.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık onu yenebiliriz o zaman.Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.04,0:26:05.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyimser olunur da bu kadar mı olunur?Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.81,0:26:20.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco!Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.77,0:26:23.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burayı kolayca geçebileceğini sanma!Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.77,0:26:29.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca dışarıdaki samuraylar da şimdiye kadar nalları dikmiştir.Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.48,0:26:34.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden'in oğlu da ölsün, bu savaş sona erecek.Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.82,0:26:39.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano da Yeni Onigashima ismiyle korsan imparatorluğuna dönüşecek!Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.70,0:26:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sahiden buna inanıyorsanız beyniniz ölmüş!Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.58,0:26:45.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sus lan, kuş bozuntusu!Dialogue: 50,0:26:52.59,0:26:54.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sikeyim! Yenilmez mi bu?Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.80,0:26:56.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne çeşit bir gücü var?Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.56,0:27:02.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeni çağla dövüşüyorsunuz!Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.60,0:27:07.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Canavar Korsanları her şeye olduğu gibi ona da hükmedecek!Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.20,0:27:18.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne–Dialogue: 50,0:27:21.12,0:27:24.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey... Bırakın geçsin işte.Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.33,0:27:25.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi, dal içeri!Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.29,0:27:30.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aniden niye fırlatıyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:27:42.18,0:27:44.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.48,0:27:45.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,L...Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.64,0:27:50.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy ağabey, Ace'in kardeşi mi?Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.06,0:27:51.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 50,0:27:51.36,0:27:52.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bilmiyor muydun?Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.86,0:27:57.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben Ace'den bahsederken gayet sakince dedi ki...Dialogue: 50,0:27:58.24,0:28:00.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace öldü.Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.95,0:28:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ağabeye çok kötü şeyler söyledim.Dialogue: 50,0:28:04.45,0:28:08.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rahatsız olsaydı kızardı zaten.Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.12,0:28:09.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Takma kafana.Dialogue: 50,0:28:09.63,0:28:10.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.92,0:28:15.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ağabey, özür dilerim!Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.01,0:28:17.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Takma kafana diyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.55,0:28:23.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O değil de demin dediğin planı uygulayalım.Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.81,0:28:29.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:29.94,0:28:32.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger'ın oğlu...Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.57,0:28:34.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve Luffy'nin ağabeyi mi o?Dialogue: 50,0:28:34.98,0:28:36.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru mu bu?Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.82,0:28:37.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hıhı.Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.24,0:28:42.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy'yi Wano'ya siz getirmediniz mi?Dialogue: 50,0:28:42.74,0:28:43.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 50,0:28:44.45,0:28:48.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sayısız korsan arasında karşınıza çıkanlar onlardı,Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.96,0:28:51.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve siz de onları bu topraklara getirdiniz...Dialogue: 50,0:28:51.67,0:28:54.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunun kaderden başka bir açıklaması olamaz!Dialogue: 50,0:28:56.17,0:28:57.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çünkü...Dialogue: 50,0:28:58.05,0:29:02.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy'nin adında da "D." var!Dialogue: 50,0:29:17.82,0:29:19.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nefis!Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.66,0:29:25.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ateş çok güzel.Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.25,0:29:34.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leziz!Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.09,0:29:42.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tıka basa doydum!Dialogue: 50,0:29:42.14,0:29:45.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şarj oldum!Dialogue: 50,0:29:45.01,0:29:47.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yemek işiniz bitti mi?Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.06,0:29:48.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, Mama!Dialogue: 50,0:29:48.56,0:29:50.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de hazırım.Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.19,0:29:54.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidelim öyleyse.Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.95,0:30:09.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka daha gelmedi mi?Dialogue: 50,0:30:09.16,0:30:11.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:30:11.08,0:30:15.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimi öldürürsen öldür ama Nico Robin'e dokunma.Dialogue: 50,0:30:16.79,0:30:21.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu sendeki üç gözlü, antik yazıları okuyamıyor mu?Dialogue: 50,0:30:21.26,0:30:22.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pudding mi?Dialogue: 50,0:30:22.80,0:30:24.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bilmem.Dialogue: 50,0:30:24.26,0:30:27.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uyanışını bekleyecek sabrım kalmadı.Dialogue: 50,0:30:27.26,0:30:30.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mesele anlaşıldı.Dialogue: 50,0:30:34.19,0:30:39.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elimizden gelen bu kadar, geçin lütfen.Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.23,0:30:41.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çatı katına giden merdiven bu.Dialogue: 50,0:30:42.15,0:30:44.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sağ ol, Shishimamushi!Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.20,0:30:45.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adım Shishilian.Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.87,0:30:47.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayatınız pahasına...Dialogue: 50,0:30:47.99,0:30:52.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo'yu koruduğunuzu asla unutmayacağım.Dialogue: 50,0:30:52.41,0:30:53.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sağ olun.Dialogue: 50,0:30:54.29,0:30:55.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Görüşürüz.Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.88,0:31:04.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki adayı nereye indireceksin?Dialogue: 50,0:31:04.01,0:31:08.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çiçek Başkenti'nde Kozuki'yi temsil eden bir ada var.Dialogue: 50,0:31:11.02,0:31:13.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu an halk, dans edip eğleniyor.Dialogue: 50,0:31:13.52,0:31:15.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sayısız insan ölecek.Dialogue: 50,0:31:15.48,0:31:16.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiç önemli değil.Dialogue: 50,0:31:16.85,0:31:19.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Köleden bol ne var?Dialogue: 50,0:31:23.24,0:31:26.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Görkemli bir başkent olacak.Dialogue: 50,0:31:29.12,0:31:31.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki yol poneglifi?Dialogue: 50,0:31:31.41,0:31:32.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orada değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:31:33.79,0:31:36.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hemen asıl niyetini belli etme!Dialogue: 50,0:31:36.71,0:31:38.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana tepeden bakma!Dialogue: 50,0:31:38.63,0:31:42.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hâlâ gözümde küçük kardeşten farksızsın.Dialogue: 50,0:31:44.38,0:31:47.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tanrı Vadisi'nde Rocks Korsanları'nın dağıldığı gün...Dialogue: 50,0:31:47.89,0:31:53.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sana mitolojik zoan olan Balık-Balık Meyvesi'ni vermiştim.Dialogue: 50,0:31:53.81,0:31:57.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana hayatın boyunca borçlusun, Kaido.Dialogue: 50,0:31:57.77,0:31:59.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her neyse.Dialogue: 50,0:32:05.15,0:32:08.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu o zaman konuşuruz.Dialogue: 50,0:32:08.24,0:32:10.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One Piece'i ele geçirince!Dialogue: 50,0:32:08.24,0:32:10.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One Piece'i ele geçirince!Dialogue: 2,0:01:34.78,0:01:39.62,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Seninle İçmek İçin Hazırladığım SakeDialogue: 1,0:01:34.78,0:01:39.62,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Seninle İçmek İçin Hazırladığım SakeDialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:08.94,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,"Anka Kuşu" Marco Eski Beyazsakal Korsanları ÜyesiDialogue: 1,0:02:06.48,0:02:08.94,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,"Anka Kuşu" Marco 